        <mxCell id="instructions" value="HOW TO USE THIS FILE&#10;&#10;1. Open https://app.diagrams.net &gt; File &gt; Open from &gt; Device &gt; select this file.&#10;2. Refine the diagram visually: swap the cylinder placeholders for richer DB / server icons (+ More Shapes &gt; Networking, AWS, GCP).&#10;3. Add icons for tools (BLAST, Bowtie, etc.) from the same libraries if you want.&#10;4. When ready: File &gt; Export as &gt; SVG &gt; check 'Embed Images' &amp; 'Transparent Background' &gt; save as public/pipeline.svg in this repo.&#10;5. The PipelineSection component automatically uses /pipeline.svg as the primary diagram; the existing Mermaid is kept as fallback." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#a89320;fillColor=#fbf3c4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="520" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

